<title>HUNGARY: Hungary int. reserves fall to $9 bln in Jan.</title>
<headline>Hungary int. reserves fall to $9 bln in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves fell to $9 billion in January from $9.75 billion in December 1996, the National Bank of Hungary said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
